atterli perchè addestrati a non provare più alcun sentimento di terrore. Il figlio di uno dei ranger più noti e stimati si troverà in mezzo ad un atterraggio di fortuna, assieme al padre e ad un esemplare alieno, su un pianeta da tempo disabitato dall'uomo, la Terra. Lì il figlio dovrà dimostrare al padre, reso infermo dall'atterraggio di fortuna, di essere all'altezza del titolo di \"ranger\".","tagline":"Il pericolo è reale, la paura è una scelta."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"One thousand years after cataclysmic events forced humanity's escape from Earth, Nova Prime has become mankind's new home. Legendary General Cypher Raige returns from an extended tour of duty to his estranged family, ready to be a father to his 13-year-old son, Kitai. When an asteroid storm damages Cypher and Kitai's craft, they crash-land on a now unfamiliar and dangerous Earth. As his father lies dying in the cockpit, Kitai must trek across the hostile terrain to recover their rescue beacon. His whole life, Kitai has wanted nothing more than to be a soldier like his father. Today, he gets his chance.","tagline":"Danger is real, fear is a choice."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xK8DdKTOrciDkVe0iIP1DWqavZB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e3posvSzYf9PjrQg27W64Kyc8qq.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":82700,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xK8DdKTOrciDkVe0iIP1DWqavZB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xK8DdKTOrciDkVe0iIP1DWqavZB.jpg","language":"it","width":900,"height":1286},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xK8DdKTOrciDkVe0iIP1DWqavZB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xK8DdKTOrciDkVe0iIP1DWqavZB.jpg","language":"it","width":900,"height":1286}